as roots ${t}_{1}=-5$ and ${t}_{2}=5,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=4,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t-{t}_{1})(t-{t}_{2}) & =(4)(t-(-5))(t-5) \\\\  & =4(t+5)(t-5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(t+5)(t-5) & =4({t}^{2}-25) \\\\  & =4{t}^{2}-100.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(t)=4{t}^{2}-100.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-46582/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b2478305-485c-53a6-9d6c-a72e0764dd4e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46582"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-46575/selection/aa23cfbdf8d6ec0c85f247bfb6ccef118f24a762c576bb095c930474af2d6b35" :answer/id #uuid "9c11fd91-6a87-5267-bfdf-5019faca7722" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{t}^{2}+18t+24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46575/selection/382d1041f8b4bca185d375940ac1a49d800640ff3625ba018ad9569ad55c6b94" :answer/id #uuid "6c9c9e5e-7dbf-5a7a-9563-c6919011e447" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{t}^{2}+6t-8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46575/selection/552d5afe448b2b30eb15e825400aca6d5e2ab4bb829fcffba491a8bcd68bf261" :answer/id #uuid "4d927956-3793-5646-a27f-2df91a3d9eea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{t}^{2}+18t-24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46575/selection/474a726ae18d77defc0ef4160b4681d4a070016119dc5693b9d69ed1583df7fa" :answer/id #uuid "91492fe1-593b-5116-800a-fa725c9871d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{t}^{2}-24t-24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46575/selection/f736822ea3890cfb7ede20fe3d7bc6f86dab439cf3c386df2345c2f79f310877" :answer/id #uuid "0ffb8fca-2e9f-5905-9947-66dd4660264a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{t}^{2}-6t+8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46575/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "92ef6ad4-e62d-510b-981f-f55264ff5c34" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-46575/selection/552d5afe448b2b30eb15e825400aca6d5e2ab4bb829fcffba491a8bcd68bf261" :answer-field/choices ["q-46575/selection/aa23cfbdf8d6ec0c85f247bfb6ccef118f24a762c576bb095c930474af2d6b35" "q-46575/selection/382d1041f8b4bca185d375940ac1a49d800640ff3625ba018ad9569ad55c6b94" "q-46575/selection/552d5afe448b2b30eb15e825400aca6d5e2ab4bb829fcffba491a8bcd68bf261" "q-46575/selection/474a726ae18d77defc0ef4160b4681d4a070016119dc5693b9d69ed1583df7fa" "q-46575/selection/f736822ea3890cfb7ede20fe3d7bc6f86dab439cf3c386df2345c2f79f310877"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-46575" :question/id #uuid "25c39bba-bfc2-5bc7-ae64-8a07493fe9b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-46575" :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $P(t)$ has roots ${t}_{1}=4,{t}_{2}=2,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $-3.$ Find $P(t).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has roots ${t}_{1}=4$ and ${t}_{2}=2,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=-3,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t-{t}_{1})(t-{t}_{2}) & =(-3)(t-4)(t-2) \\\\  & =(-3)(t-4)(t-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-3)(t-4)(t-2) & =(-3)({t}^{2}-6t+8) \\\\  & =-3{t}^{2}+18t-24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(t)=-3{t}^{2}+18t-24.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-46575/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b2478305-485c-53a6-9d6c-a72e0764dd4e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46575"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-46580"] :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $P(t)$ has roots ${t}_{1}=4,{t}_{2}=3,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $2.$ Find $P(t).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has roots ${t}_{1}=4$ and ${t}_{2}=3,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t-{t}_{1})(t-{t}_{2}) & =(2)(t-4)(t-3) \\\\  & =2(t-4)(t-3)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(t-4)(t-3) & =2({t}^{2}-7t+12) \\\\  & =2{t}^{2}-14t+24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(t)=2{t}^{2}-14t+24.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-107695/selection/b50c091d9f47f19b0cf63a8a598bbdd5557aa172fc877453cdc6a985c481db6d" :answer/id #uuid "96dc2268-34c8-5561-a2a0-2ce38ba6accf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{y}^{2}-4y+24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107695/selection/8b088e9125624b450b96df8fa72f0e7fc2330f72165b3268bf94d1c21c0e1e21" :answer/id #uuid "9e4079ec-58cf-5d5a-9821-718da5c586f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{y}^{2}-12y+32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107695/selection/e61aaf781292b83297cc3b5ed804b5c04a92f2214bf92853bd90d19bbdad6b8a" :answer/id #uuid "38da6fda-eb86-5d1b-9824-34442c3353b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{y}^{2}-8y+16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107695/selection/dc29ecfd47c82c2b6d2d8e83274cce7c67f41b5533200f3d1eb17b56b9ecf8b5" :answer/id #uuid "d62d10f9-9481-5ed6-ba3c-c78fd02e0d3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{y}^{2}-24y+48" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107695/selection/30fc825229a61061ee0fae8759b4ca441f63fe7563ced2f69940ca4190b2d753" :answer/id #uuid "802b9584-bb20-55cb-8e74-930d7e4bddc4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{y}^{2}-3y+96" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107695/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e9682328-9250-599d-8be2-3c20d60571db" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-107695/selection/dc29ecfd47c82c2b6d2d8e83274cce7c67f41b5533200f3d1eb17b56b9ecf8b5" :answer-field/choices ["q-107695/selection/b50c091d9f47f19b0cf63a8a598bbdd5557aa172fc877453cdc6a985c481db6d" "q-107695/selection/8b088e9125624b450b96df8fa72f0e7fc2330f72165b3268bf94d1c21c0e1e21" "q-107695/selection/e61aaf781292b83297cc3b5ed804b5c04a92f2214bf92853bd90d19bbdad6b8a" "q-107695/selection/dc29ecfd47c82c2b6d2d8e83274cce7c67f41b5533200f3d1eb17b56b9ecf8b5" "q-107695/selection/30fc825229a61061ee0fae8759b4ca441f63fe7563ced2f69940ca4190b2d753"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-107695" :question/id #uuid "59a0c362-ff2d-5bd3-9fe0-170e7fdb2dd3" :question/math-academy-id "q-107695" :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $P(y)$ has the double root ${y}_{1}={y}_{2}=4,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=3.$ Find $P(y).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has the double root ${y}_{1}={y}_{2}=4,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=3,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(y-{y}_{1})^{2} & =3{(y-4)}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{(y-4)}^{2} & =3({y}^{2}-8y+16) \\\\  & =3{y}^{2}-24y+48.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(y)=3{y}^{2}-24y+48.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-107695/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b0262c8-c029-5a72-846b-1b4f4f3306ba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107695"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-104330/selection/ef6414034e8335dbaf36a005e42a6a82cfe366610c69e447a763a1537e0aa3bc" :answer/id #uuid "eed7dfcf-ebac-554a-ad89-ab7a2456b953" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9{x}^{2}-6x-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104330/selection/70ce8b36ae6f702d9acabf75d540e70ebe6e1e0c26ae3ace34281235d84f1405" :answer/id #uuid "4a7854b8-c2cb-5989-9dec-46d0258bf5f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9{x}^{2}+12x+4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104330/selection/c926e1325f7aca849985d613c858721a627723db0b152d9e1016acd70584020b" :answer/id #uuid