ng the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{(x+\\frac{2}{3})}^{2} & =9({x}^{2}+\\frac{4}{3}x+\\frac{4}{9}) \\\\  & =9{x}^{2}+12x+4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=9{x}^{2}+12x+4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-104330/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b0262c8-c029-5a72-846b-1b4f4f3306ba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104330"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-282084/field-1/fb9b35d78be8ac43f29cf31f21fcc2944d01159bca72095195cac3295498831a" :answer/id #uuid "a6a8efd4-7954-5478-a98e-1b722075bc11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9x^2+54x-81" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-282084/field-1/f61159071315bff0356c82d036d21b7d30d8f225426c24439ffcca610d0b6295" :answer/id #uuid "3a1c40a6-51b9-5b4b-833e-26bc1c65e93f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9x^2-54x-81" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-282084/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "13b76ca6-d321-50f7-88b7-6e5404c215e4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-282084/field-1/fb9b35d78be8ac43f29cf31f21fcc2944d01159bca72095195cac3295498831a" :answer-field/choices ["q-282084/field-1/fb9b35d78be8ac43f29cf31f21fcc2944d01159bca72095195cac3295498831a" "q-282084/field-1/f61159071315bff0356c82d036d21b7d30d8f225426c24439ffcca610d0b6295"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-282084" :question/id #uuid "53935da2-c3cd-5bfa-a008-a66892a65894" :question/math-academy-id "q-282084" :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $P(x)$ has the double root ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=3,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=-9.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has the double root ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=3,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=-9,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})^{2} & =(-9){(x-3)}^{2} \\\\  & =-9(x-3)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-9(x-3)^{2} & =-9({x}^{2}-6x+9) \\\\  & =-9{x}^{2}+54x-81.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=-9{x}^{2}+54x-81.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-282084/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b0262c8-c029-5a72-846b-1b4f4f3306ba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-282084"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-46590/selection/822eacf0579764282cb2001e27f542512eb9b41c63547cd2d4229ee5521bd4ee" :answer/id #uuid "79d3e4f6-c1f1-5dd5-a3a1-21c041d5f238" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{y}^{2}-10y+50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46590/selection/8f844d42954aaca40879de7d366a47bcebdc481b91cd9675bf6248665d4bf6bf" :answer/id #uuid "269e768f-cc4a-51e8-94c2-208d91e75570" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{y}^{2}+20y-50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46590/selection/35ddda228ca23c31124697f9ca68cc275acbaf90085bd831acfd16095ef34175" :answer/id #uuid "fab60a97-529a-5f49-8208-14e5d5ac3666" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{y}^{2}+20y+50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46590/selection/3e0611785e4a2bf966eedaf56def96e74c3d73651eefe2f6397f0a30d7a3e66b" :answer/id #uuid "a32ccf9e-7e25-55de-a415-8f564bafaa04" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{y}^{2}-20y-50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46590/selection/0a7e9f2d5798b0d132009a409df267256e33353bd201fa67404bedc92a37e33f" :answer/id #uuid "be229dfa-2c74-5937-b172-229756cb25ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{y}^{2}+10y-50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46590/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8fffbd29-bec8-58a3-94fb-50ac24c53a03" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-46590/selection/3e0611785e4a2bf966eedaf56def96e74c3d73651eefe2f6397f0a30d7a3e66b" :answer-field/choices ["q-46590/selection/822eacf0579764282cb2001e27f542512eb9b41c63547cd2d4229ee5521bd4ee" "q-46590/selection/8f844d42954aaca40879de7d366a47bcebdc481b91cd9675bf6248665d4bf6bf" "q-46590/selection/35ddda228ca23c31124697f9ca68cc275acbaf90085bd831acfd16095ef34175" "q-46590/selection/3e0611785e4a2bf966eedaf56def96e74c3d73651eefe2f6397f0a30d7a3e66b" "q-46590/selection/0a7e9f2d5798b0d132009a409df267256e33353bd201fa67404bedc92a37e33f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-46590" :question/id #uuid "1ccc0604-a69e-5d71-a18b-0a7af8ee586a" :question/math-academy-id "q-46590" :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $P(y)$ has the double root ${y}_{1}={y}_{2}=-5,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=-2.$ Find $P(y).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has the double root ${y}_{1}={y}_{2}=-5,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=-2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(y-{y}_{1})^{2} & =(-2){(y-(-5))}^{2} \\\\  & =(-2){(y+5)}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-2){(y+5)}^{2} & =(-2)({y}^{2}+10y+25) \\\\  & =-2{y}^{2}-20y-50.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(y)=-2{y}^{2}-20y-50.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-46590/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b0262c8-c029-5a72-846b-1b4f4f3306ba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46590"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-282122/field-1/c1722873392aad2ef8e4dc40bbfe9d849631e01a06d57e8777b100c6b19786fb" :answer/id #uuid "88fd2a55-335e-545a-9224-7891cf533fca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16x^2+128x+256" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-282122/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ab298844-eadf-5699-8f27-153cda985b42" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-282122/field-1/c1722873392aad2ef8e4dc40bbfe9d849631e01a06d57e8777b100c6b19786fb" :answer-field/choices ["q-282122/field-1/c1722873392aad2ef8e4dc40bbfe9d849631e01a06d57e8777b100c6b19786fb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-282122" :question/id #uuid "92f379ad-bc52-54c7-9314-d46129849845" :question/math-academy-id "q-282122" :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $P(x)$ has the double root ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=-4,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=16.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has the double root ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=-4,$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=16,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})^{2} & =16{(x-(-4))}^{2} \\\\  & =16(x+4)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}16(x+4)^{2} & =16({x}^{2}+8x+16) \\\\  & =16{x}^{2}+128x+256.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=16{x}^{2}+128x+256.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-282122/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b0262c8-c029-5a72-846b-1b4f4f3306ba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-282122"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-46594/selection/24cec71cd41b88b44fe01d328ff951c2cbe7c67eb091e0e5075f209470974887" :answer/id #uuid "0e25af3c-27f9-5205-a41f-4c3bbfca749d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{z}^{2}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46594/selection/cd728c5005e9040e8dfb8923d1a33290a0cd513e720b2974e670e10c09c6f886" :answer/id #uuid "2650b60f-b19f-5980-811b-db11bd19e60d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{z}^{2}+2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46594/selection/fc2872f30ca083d220ab32ef6e3678cc221f4dc7139503f3d09c939229b30a18" :answer/id #uuid "97fc9d72-6f45-5223-95e4-e835af2ae7cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{z}^{2}+4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46594/selection/119caa577d889b265ff25d73fda079b46f770578a5f43b4172a96f1a165b22ea" :answer/id #uuid "22b0bb66-ab2a-5a27-af14-2a0a0dbada61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{z}^{2}-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46594/selection/55d5f93b64b6865b084ef95c5e2adcae4de9af75a40fb676575bf85574ec5012" :answer/id #uuid "2c03922d-a364-5bb2-980a-2ab035218047" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{z}^{2}-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46594/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "03190460-1db9-50a6-8b3d-1303c0b22c90" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-46594/selection/fc2872f30ca083d220ab32ef6e3678cc221f4dc7139503f3d09c939229b30a18" :answer-field/choices ["q-46594/selection/24cec71cd41b88b44fe01d328ff951c2cbe7c67eb091e0e5075f209470974887" "q-46594/selection/cd728c5005e9040e8dfb8923d1a33290a0cd513e720b2974e670e10c09c6f886" "q-46594/selection/fc2872f30ca083d220ab32ef6e3678cc221f4dc7139503f3d09c939229b30a18" "q-46594/selection/119caa577d889b265ff25d73fda079b46f770578a5f43b4172a96f1a165b22ea" "q-46594/selection/55d5f93b64b6865b084ef95c5e2adcae4de9af75a40fb676575bf85574ec5012"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-46594" :question/id #uuid "1531518c-9671-50f9-8c99-70bc75711080" :question/math-academy-id "q-46594" :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $f(z)$ has real coefficients, has roots ${z}_{1}=2\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=-2\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $1.$ Find $f(z).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has roots ${z}_{1}=2\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=-2\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=1,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(z-{z}_{1})(z-{z}_{2}) & =(1)(z-2\\text{i})(z-(-2\\text{i})) \\\\  & =(z-2\\text{i})(z+2\\text{i})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(z-2\\text{i})(z+2\\text{i}) & ={z}^{2}-(2\\text{i})^{2} \\\\  & ={z}^{2}-4{\\text{i}}^{2} \\\\  & ={z}^{2}+4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(z)={z}^{2}+4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-46594/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "70c149d8-3739-564c-97c5-6636860ad0c4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46594"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-28185/selection/9615468039fbf94505ac5394b59e66666e2d38f988f5ade9024da2c6309f2cf9" :answer/id #uuid "8fb81792-2508-50b0-b4c3-5843b32ea1e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}-36" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-28185/selection/41963962b8cff66a3cdaa59e0fa7d882120aed58a99bf9a4d5068a8503792995" :answer/id #uuid "1c99ca4c-6e50-57a0-abea-7aa3d3256586" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}-16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-28185/selection/ed7adc0626902eecee85710e246175168a38bbbb432b2d0085fd448566bff4ae" :answer/id #uuid "e82f38af-2ea4-5fce-baff-aba2b3906f35" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+36" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-28185/selection/4e1b4af767883b039edb0a2f0f6c226c727a5cab82afe50a61a99b012e23a08e" :answer/id #uuid "15850e13-27b4-56b7-9ddf-acad6b8a765a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-28185/selection/4d1764c32578cf6419271464b54049c51d84af9d597f99057bb6d14d837b3ad0" :answer/id #uuid "e0e69f3e-7e73-5ba5-a080-06becba660d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}+6x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-28185/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "169fea92-0a98-5a18-862d-e0f4fa917768" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-28185/selection/ed7adc0626902eecee85710e246175168a38bbbb432b2d0085fd448566bff4ae" :answer-field/choices ["q-28185/selection/9615468039fbf94505ac5394b59e66666e2d38f988f5ade9024da2c6309f2cf9" "q-28185/selection/41963962b8cff66a3cdaa59e0fa7d882120aed58a99bf9a4d5068a8503792995" "q-28185/selection/ed7adc0626902eecee85710e246175168a38bbbb432b2d0085fd448566bff4ae" "q-28185/selection/4e1b4af767883b039edb0a2f0f6c226c727a5cab82afe50a61a99b012e23a08e" "q-28185/selection/4d1764c32578cf6419271464b54049c51d84af9d597f99057bb6d14d837b3ad0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-28185" :question/id #uuid "847b083e-81ae-5df7-a482-aef291b5630a" :question/math-academy-id "q-28185" :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $f(x)$ has real coefficients, has roots ${x}_{1}=6\\text{i}$ and ${x}_{2}=-6\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $1.$ Find $f(x).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=6\\text{i}$ and ${x}_{2}=-6\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=1,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2}) & =(1)(x-6\\text{i})(x-(-6\\text{i})) \\\\  & =(x-6\\text{i})(x+6\\text{i})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-6\\text{i})(x+6\\text{i}) & ={x}^{2}-(6\\text{i})^{2} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-36{\\text{i}}^{2} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}+36.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)={x}^{2}+36.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-28185/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "70c149d8-3739-564c-97c5-6636860ad0c4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-28185"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-46596"] :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $f(z)$ has real coefficients, has roots ${z}_{1}=4\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=-4\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $-1.$ Find $f(z).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has roots ${z}_{1}=4\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=-4\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=-1,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(z-{z}_{1})(z-{z}_{2}) & =(-1)(z-4\\text{i})(z-(-4\\text{i})) \\\\  & =-(z-4\\text{i})(z+4\\text{i})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-(z-4\\text{i})(z+4\\text{i}) & =-({z}^{2}-(4\\text{i})^{2}) \\\\  & =-({z}^{2}-16{\\text{i}}^{2}) \\\\  & =-({z}^{2}+16) \\\\  & =-{z}^{2}-16.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(z)=-{z}^{2}-16.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-46664/selection/f7df17bcdf6ab912424d88c1e5a0c1b1b6ed847ca8c95542aadf0c297be053f2" :answer/id #uuid "3be52e73-35e6-5f96-baf8-8c8d3dc9b8dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{z}^{2}-12z-13" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46664/selection/08c59f40a209fc115cb63a892735cecc99ac8a842e365baef4e9fad9cd777d98" :answer/id #uuid "01cee8da-4989-5c98-9f38-25611a052d70" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{z}^{2}+12z-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46664/selection/e3df7df17b2f1d8422778ee9eef95e516b2afdce671246244ceafa1de0685641" :answer/id #uuid "f96dc97a-7ae4-53fd-81d4-79b04fa31120" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{z}^{2}-6z+9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46664/selection/9a564d77c05cb5f5ba8bcfeefd7fb0164ad35523cd2e6cfba06040d146d812d1" :answer/id #uuid "6ecd5e1e-bcd9-528c-8db8-89357eb0b511" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{z}^{2}+6z-13" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46664/selection/8ac7d15b76cdf9f26dc42723be24192189227786587c107264cbc93ca0e12bc6" :answer/id #uuid "834877a3-4d9c-5e2f-b3c6-bfb30ee49dff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{z}^{2}+12z-26" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46664/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7cced0f7-018b-50e6-8198-66207ebedcbf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-46664/selection/8ac7d15b76cdf9f26dc42723be24192189227786587c107264cbc93ca0e12bc6" :answer-field/choices ["q-46664/selection/f7df17bcdf6ab912424d88c1e5a0c1b1b6ed847ca8c95542aadf0c297be053f2" "q-46664/selection/08c59f40a209fc115cb63a892735cecc99ac8a842e365baef4e9fad9cd777d98" "q-46664/selection/e3df7df17b2f1d8422778ee9eef95e516b2afdce671246244ceafa1de0685641" "q-46664/selection/9a564d77c05cb5f5ba8bcfeefd7fb0164ad35523cd2e6cfba06040d146d812d1" "q-46664/selection/8ac7d15b76cdf9f26dc42723be24192189227786587c107264cbc93ca0e12bc6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-46664" :question/id #uuid "b2b41d84-5bdc-5407-b7e8-a6afaca4585d" :question/math-academy-id "q-46664" :question/problem "The quadratic polynomial $f(z)$ has real coefficients, has roots ${z}_{1}=3+2\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=3-2\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $-2.$ Find $f(z).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our quadratic polynomial has roots ${z}_{1}=3+2\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=3-2\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=-2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(z-{z}_{1})(z-{z}_{2}) & =(-2)(z-(3+2\\text{i}))(z-(3-2\\text{i}))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-2)(z-(3+2\\text{i}))(z-(3-2\\text{i})) & =(-2)({z}^{2}-(3+2\\text{i})z-(3-2\\text{i})z+(3+2\\text{i})(3-2\\text{i})) \\\\  & =(-2)({z}^{2}-(3+2\\text{i}+3-2\\text{i})z+({3}^{2}-{2}^{2}{\\text{i}}^{2})) \\\\  & =(-2)({z}^{2}-6z+(9+4)) \\\\  & =-2{z}^{2}+12z-26.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(z)=-2{z}^{2}+12z-26.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-46664/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "70c149d8-3739-564c-97c5-6636860ad0c4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-46664"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-46643/selection/d487e4428c27d4077c2f24010df549423bfe53a778fca3988dc931f2f546dd4f" :answer/id #uuid "df104dba-92c2-5910-90d1-d082b9379f5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{y}^{2}-12y+16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-46643/selection/41a854eebd8acd62040c219ee2188896016af7b06f9a2db1f59399165860e375" :answer/id #uuid "f